  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Balu Ashok vs The State Of Andhra Pradesh on 20 August, 2020 Author: K. Suresh Reddy Bench: K. Suresh Reddy The Hon'Ble Sri Justice K. Suresh Reddy Criminal Petition No.3288 Of 2020 Order:",
    "facts": "This is a Criminal Petition is filed by the petitioners under Section 482 of the Code of Criminal Procedure to quash the proceedings against the petitioners, in FIR No.171 of 2020, dated 23.07.2020, on the file of III Town Police Station, Tenali, Guntur District. The offences alleged are under Sections 188, 420, 270, 273, 328 of IPC and Sections 56, 57(1), 63 of Food Safety and Standards Act.",
    "arguments": "2. Counsel for the petitioners has places reliance on the common order dated 18.12.2019 passed by a coordinate Bench of this Court in Criminal Petition Nos.5421 of 2019 and batch, holding that \"tobacco\" does not fall within the definition of \"food\", as specified under Section 3(i)(j) of the Act, therefore, registration of FIR is not permissible.",
    "petitioner_arguments": "2. Counsel for the petitioners has places reliance on the common order dated 18.12.2019 passed by a coordinate Bench of this Court in Criminal Petition Nos.5421 of 2019 and batch, holding that \"tobacco\" does not fall within the definition of \"food\", as specified under Section 3(i)(j) of the Act, therefore, registration of FIR is not permissible.",
